  "schema:name": "PHWImpliedConsent",
  "dcterms:title": "PHW Implied Consent",
  "dcterms:description": "A consent the holder did not give by any act: categorized with an HL7 ActConsentDirective code (IMPLIED, IMPLIEDD or NOPP); the trust domain's default policy applies, normally an IHE PCF implicit policy (Volume 1 §1:53.2.1). Consent.policy names it, and the domain's published policy is the evidence (sourceAttachment). Carried in a document so that a receiver can see which policy the data was shared under.",
